    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey my husband had a bit of a flu last week but he seems to be getting a weird fever again today like 103ish and a really bad headache. he's also acting a little bit out of it and slow when he talks but i think he's just super tired from being sick for so long. should i just give him more advil or do i need to take him in?",
